# Environment Configuration Template

## Frontend Environment Variables
# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:7000
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=HMS Platform

# Optional: Analytics
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=G_xxxxxxxxxxxx

---

## Backend Environment Variables (appsettings.json)
# Database Configuration
ConnectionStrings__DefaultConnection=Host=localhost;Port=5432;Database=hms;Username=postgres;Password=Hana#2017

# Logging
Logging__LogLevel__Default=Information
Logging__LogLevel__Microsoft=Warning

# API Configuration
Kestrel__Endpoints__Https__Url=https://0.0.0.0:7000
Kestrel__Endpoints__Http__Url=http://0.0.0.0:5000

# CORS
CORS__AllowedOrigins=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:3001,http://153.75.224.163:3000

# JWT (when implementing authentication)
Jwt__Secret=your_secret_key_here_minimum_32_characters
Jwt__Issuer=hms-platform
Jwt__Audience=hms-platform-users
Jwt__ExpirationMinutes=60

---

## Database Environment Variables
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=hms_platform
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=your_password
DB_SCHEMA=public

---

## Third-Party Integrations (Future)
# WhatsApp API (Twilio or AWS SNS)
# WHATSAPP_API_KEY=your_api_key
# WHATSAPP_ACCOUNT_SID=your_account_sid

# Email Configuration (SendGrid or SMTP)
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASSWORD=your_app_password

---

## Development vs Production
# Use .env.development.local for dev-specific variables
# Use .env.production.local for prod-specific variables
# Use .env.local for local overrides (not committed to git)

